#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/intel-media.xml:35
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>intel-media</application> package provides a VA API driver "
"for Intel GPUs that are provided with Broadwell CPUs and higher. This "
"includes support for a variety of codecs."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>intel-media</application> fornece um controlador VA "
"API para GPUs da Intel fornecidas com CPUs Broadwell e superiores. Isso "
"inclui suporte para uma variedade de codificadores."

